    n_grove: 'Crystal grove', n_garden: 'Coral garden', n_vent: 'Warm rift', n_wreck: 'Wreck of a galleon',
    grove: ['Violet crystals stand between the rocks, close together. They glow from within, as if someone had forgotten a light inside them.', 'A grove of crystals. When the headlight hits them, they throw the light back in colours.'],
    garden: ['A garden of corals, turquoise and lilac. Specks of light everywhere, and small fish moving out of the boat’s way.', 'Corals as far as the headlight reaches. It is brighter here than elsewhere, and it feels inhabited.'],
    vent: ['A rift in the ground, glowing warm and orange. The water shimmers above it and bubbles rise.', 'Something glows between dark rock needles. The only warm light in a long time, apart from my own.'],
    wreck: ['A ship lying on its side. A light is still burning in the stern, and no one is here who could have lit it.'],
    n_plain: 'The silent plain', n_whale: 'Whale skeleton', n_bell: 'Diving bell',
    s_grove: 'Crystal grove', s_grotto: 'Crystal grotto', s_garden: 'Coral garden', s_vent: 'Warm rift', s_wreck: 'Shipwreck', s_plain: 'Snow plain', s_whale: 'Whale skeleton', s_bell: 'Diving bell', s_hole: 'The hole', compass: ['N', 'E', 'S', 'W'],
    plain: ['The ground falls away, and suddenly everything is quiet. It is snowing. Fine white flakes sink out of the dark, so slowly, as if nobody down here were in a hurry.'],
    whale: ['A whale, or what is left of one. The ribs arch above me like the vault of a church. Something grows on the bones and glows very faintly.'],
    bell: ['An old cast-iron diving bell, tilted in the sand and covered in rust. The little windows are blind. Someone lowered it here a very long time ago and never brought it back up.'],
