    mis_m1: 'The old galleon', mish_m1: 'By the old galleon, a little under four hundred metres north-east of the starting canyon, lies a brass canister with a small light.', misd_m1: 'Recovered the canister by the galleon. Inside: the tape “The old galleon” and a page about the ship. Next to it lay a copper kettle, which now sits on the stove.',
